        "payload": "tree 2e4747601fb673223526425140930167310f2855\nparent a0c977f3755da6476b955677ca9318334a2432c4\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1791672900 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793832964 +0100\n\nbip-0327: add test vectors for cases no vector covers\n\nNew cases:\n- one signer: nonce_agg of one nonce, sign, verify, sig_agg\n- a 100-byte message\n- a plain and an x-only tweak over a 38-byte message (det_sign)\n- an extra_in shorter than 32 bytes\n- a secnonce whose second half is zero\n- a secnonce generated for another signer's public key\n- fewer pubnonces than pubkeys at verify\n- fewer is_xonly flags than tweaks\n- a 31-byte tweak\n\nreference.py computed every value. The sig_agg case is generated by\ngen_vectors_helper.py, which now includes it.\n",
